<title>EGYPT: Egypt firm says seeks 10,000 tonnes yellow corn.</title>
<headline>Egypt firm says seeks 10,000 tonnes yellow corn.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Privatised firm Egyptian Starch and Glucose said on Sunday it was seeking 10,000 tonnes +/- 25 percent buyers option of yellow corn of Egyptian, U.S. or Argentinian origin.</p>
<p>The firm said in an announcement the deadline for bids was Thursday June 12.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
